<% slot = @notification.notifiable %>
Hi <%= @notification.recipient.name %>,

You're on for tomorrow. Thanks for signing up.

Slot: <%= slot.label %>
Project: <%= @project.name %>
When: <%= [ mail_date(slot.date), (mail_time(slot.starts_at_time) if slot.starts_at_time) ].compact.join(" at ") %>

Can't make it anymore? Open the Project and give up your spot so someone else can take it:

<%= project_url(@project) %>
